SUMMARY:Misc Connections: A Purely Analog Olio House Party
DESCRIPTION:What to expect:8pm: You're matched with new friends to discuss 
 a couple of curated prompts.9:30pm-midnight: Join DJs WiFiOG and Vinylaura
  for an all vinyl party at the Lighthouse. Drinks\, conversation\, amazing
  music and dancing throughout.Tickets:To attend this party you can sign up
  for our monthly membership which gives you 2 free events each month.You m
 ust be 21 or older to attend.What is Think Olio?Think Olio is an ongoing e
 xperiment in lifelong learning. We are a community of open-minded people w
 ho gather to exchange ideas with new friends and connect over art\, litera
 ture\, and philosophy.An Olio is what we call the social learning events w
 e’ve been organizing since 2015. A blend between a lecture and a house p
 arty\, Olios are led by a teacher who loves sharing their passions and the
  room is filled with curious\, open-minded New Yorkers.&nbsp\;Eight months
  into creating a venue\, one of our favorite feelings has been the moments
  where we’ve stepped outside of time. We’ve created a space where conv
 ersations don’t feel rushed\, people are greeted with hugs\, and as a co
 mmunity\, we spontaneously come up with new ideas (like the dial-up-disco 
 house party) and bring them to life.Our goal is to spark new perspectives\
 , ignite curiosity\, and enjoy ourselves socially—an alternative to typi
 cal nightlife options.Check out our full calendarDisclaimer: By purchasing
  a ticket\, you agree to have your photo/video used for social media/marke
 ting materials. If you prefer to not have your photo taken\, feel free to 
 send us a note.\n\nTickets & info: https://www.viewcy.com/event/misc_conne
 ctions_an_1
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/misc_connections_an_1
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6742fb8f-0fca-4ce0-9dd3-7393c35b62fd@viewcy.olio
