SUMMARY:Family Constellations: Subconscious Patterns in our Everyday Relati
 onships
DESCRIPTION:Family Constellations is a therapeutic approach that recognizes
  how our family's emotional history lives within us\, often unconsciously 
 shaping our experiences\, behaviors\, and struggles. Developed by Psychoth
 erapist\, Bert Hellinger\, this method acknowledges that healing often nee
 ds to happen at both an individual and systemic level.While traditional ta
 lk therapy primarily focuses on individual healing\, Family Constellations
  expands our perspective to include the entire family system.&nbsp\;When w
 e think of the Soul a lot comes to mind — and most of it is often confus
 ing because the one fact everyone agrees on is that it is something we can
 not see nor fully grasp. What is the Soul? Does it even exist? How can we 
 understand it?Mystics like Theresa of Avila\, scholars\, artists\, philoso
 phers\, scientists\, and even different religions have long tried to make 
 sense of the Soul\, find ways to capture it\, and/or question its existenc
 e.In this Olio we'll explore the Soul through the lens of Family Constella
 tions: an interior landscape where much of our past and that of our ancest
 ors is stored. We look at the Soul as a map that helps us navigate through
  ancestral entanglements and blocked movements within us which don’t all
 ow us to move forward in our everyday lives.&nbsp\;Listening to\, uncoveri
 ng\, and learning from these Soul movements form the core practice of Fami
 ly &amp\; Systemic Constellation work.Through interactive lecture and a br
 ief guided meditation\, we will get invited to explore our own Soul moveme
 nts to help us better understand ourselves\, our loved ones\, our family\,
  and the people around us.*Though we are learning about the ideas of Famil
 y Constellations at this Olio\, we won't be setting up constellations or w
 orking through anyone's personal family history\, and no prior experience 
 is needed.Our teacher for the evening: Luisa Muhr is a New York–based in
 terdisciplinary artist and Family &amp\; Systemic Constellations practitio
 ner\, originally from Vienna\, Austria\, with Hungarian and Anatolian-Gree
 k roots. She considers herself a “Field Worker” and was introduced to 
 Family Constellations in early childhood. Muhr later studied with her ment
 or Dr. Peter Orban\, who grew out of the early Constellation work in Germa
 ny. Alongside her healing arts practice\, Muhr is an experimental vocalist
  and interdisciplinary artist whose work spans voice\, sound\, movement\, 
 improvisation\, installation\, performance art\, and experimental music th
 eater. The evening flow: 7:00pm- Doors open\, grab a drink and get settled
 &nbsp\;7:30pm - Olio Begins!8:30 - 8:45pm - Audience Q&amp\;A&nbsp\;9:00-1
 0:00pm - Mingling at the Lighthouse&nbsp\;What Is an Olio?Think Olio is an
  ongoing experiment in lifelong learning. We are a community of open-minde
 d people who gather to exchange ideas with new friends and connect over ar
 t\, literature\, and philosophy.Check out our full calendarOur $30 members
 hip gives you two events for the price of one!&nbsp\;An Olio is what we ca
 ll the social learning events we’ve been organizing since 2015. A blend 
 between a lecture and a house party\, Olios are led by a teacher who loves
  sharing their passions and the room is filled with curious\, open-minded 
 New Yorkers.&nbsp\;Our goal is to spark new perspectives\, ignite curiosit
 y\, and enjoy ourselves socially offering an alternative to typical nightl
 ife options.Disclaimer: By purchasing a ticket\, you agree to have your ph
 oto/video used for social media/marketing materials. If you prefer to not 
 have your photo taken\, feel free to send us a note.Photo by Zhi-Da Zhong\
 n\nTickets & info: https://www.viewcy.com/event/family_constellations
URL:https://www.viewcy.com/event/family_constellations
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d5a2b78f-dcd5-4965-a7ba-28e889449384@viewcy.olio
